{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":14778,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T14:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:57:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-piu-di-50-vulnerabilita-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Aggiornamento iOS 26.5: più di 50 vulnerabilità di sicurezza corrette\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato iOS 26.5 e iPadOS 26.5 con oltre 50 correzioni di sicurezza. Nessun bug risulta sfruttato attivamente, ma è consigliato aggiornare.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/bug-security-vulnerability-issue-fix-larry-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"bug-security-vulnerability-issue-fix-larry\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14763,\"date\":\"2026-05-11T08:15:05+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-11T06:15:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-nuove-modifiche-design-organize-tabs\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: nuove modifiche al design e opzione “Organize Tabs”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, macOS 27 avrà un leggero redesign rispetto a macOS Tahoe e una funzione AI in Safari per raggruppare automaticamente le schede.\",\"categoryName\":\"macOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"macos\",\"categoryId\":100,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14697,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T09:00:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-fotocamere-